  "item_short_desc": "<p>Gear up for action and adventure with our Tactical Traveler Duffle Bags, offering an all-in-one place to carry your tactical equipment, EDC gear, and travel essentials. The equipment bag features a wide mouth main compartment with a dual zipper handle closure for quick and easy access, ensuring you are ready at a moment&rsquo;s notice. The military duffle bag makes for a great bugout bag and offers unbeatable off-road recovery storage.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": null,
  "description": "<p>Gear up for action and adventure with our Tactical Traveler Duffle Bags, offering an all-in-one place to carry your tactical equipment, EDC gear, and travel essentials. The equipment bag features a wide mouth main compartment with a dual zipper handle closure for quick and easy access, ensuring you are ready at a moment&rsquo;s notice. The military duffle bag makes for a great bugout bag and offers unbeatable off-road recovery storage. Rugged Material Construction: Engineered with tough, water-resistant PVC backed polyester, these tactical bags easily endure field missions and outdoor expeditions. Whether you are out traveling or heading to the range, these heavy-duty duffle bags provide long-lasting durability. Safe &amp; Secure Storage: The travel duffle bag utilizes 4 internal organizer pockets, a top zipper compartment, and 2 external zip pockets for additional storage. Carry Options: As part of Rothco&rsquo;s Tactical Traveler series, the duffle bag features a low-profile MOLLE compatible design and comes equipped with a removable and adjustable shoulder strap, a removable air mesh shoulder pad, dual carry handles with a handle wrap, and a grab handle for comfortable carry while traveling. In addition, the travel bag features an ID window on the outside. Multiple Sizes Available: These tactical sport duffle bags come in 2 sizes: 19 inch x 9 inch (20 Liter Capacity) / 24 inch x 12 inch (45 Liter Capacity).</p>",
